    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Saks Fifth Avenue Partnership",
      "body": "Rhode Island has inspired luxury travel since the Gilded Age, and high-income travelers remain a priority audience today. We partnered with Saks Fifth Avenue to reach that audience through an integrated campaign featuring iconic window displays in New York City. The effort extended to in-store displays in key direct-flight markets, supported by social and digital content showcasing curated Saks fashion for a Rhode Island getaway.",
      "divider": true
    },
