      "type": "section",
      "title": "The Giant Travelling Stuffie Installation",
      "body": "To highlight Rhode Island as a culinary destination, we transformed its iconic “stuffie” into a giant, three-dimensional installation placed in high-traffic airports nationwide to promote direct flights. The idea gained traction quickly and expanded into a traveling Stuffie Truck, touring events across the country and turning a local delicacy into a highly shareable, awareness-driving moment.",
      "divider": true
    },
